    <h2>About Rajasthan Technical University</h2>
    <p>
        Rajasthan Technical University (RTU), Kota is a state government university established in the year 2006 
        by the Government of Rajasthan with the objective of promoting technical education across the state. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}  
    </p>

    <p>
        The university is located on Rawatbhata Road, Kota, near the banks of the Chambal River, providing a peaceful 
        and academic-friendly environment for students. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}  
    </p>

    <div class="box">
        <h3>University Overview</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Established: 2006</li>
            <li>Type: Public Technical University</li>
            <li>Location: Kota, Rajasthan</li>
            <li>Affiliation: UGC, AICTE</li>
            <li>Students: 1.5+ Lakh across affiliated colleges</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Academic Structure</h2>
    <p>
        RTU affiliates a large number of engineering, management, and technical institutions across Rajasthan. 
        It offers a wide range of undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs in technical education. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}  
    </p>

    <div class="box">
        <h3>Courses Offered</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech)</li>
            <li>Master of Technology (M.Tech)</li>
            <li>Master of Business Administration (MBA)</li>
            <li>Master of Computer Applications (MCA)</li>
            <li>Ph.D. Programs</li>
            <li>Hotel Management Courses</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Vision</h2>
    <p>
        To achieve academic excellence in engineering and technology by imparting in-depth knowledge, promoting 
        innovation, and meeting global industrial requirements. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}  
    </p>

    <h2>Mission</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Provide quality technical education to students</li>
        <li>Encourage research and development activities</li>
        <li>Strengthen industry-institute interaction</li>
        <li>Develop skilled and industry-ready professionals</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Campus & Infrastructure</h2>
    <p>
        The RTU campus is spread across a large area and provides modern infrastructure including laboratories, 
        libraries, research centers, and hostels. The university supports academic excellence through updated 
        curriculum and facilities. :contentReference[oaicite:4]{index=4}  
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliated Colleges</h2>
    <p>
        RTU has numerous affiliated colleges including engineering, MBA, MCA, and architecture institutions, 
        making it one of the largest technical universities in Rajasthan. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}  
    </p>

